<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 120-3 V SRI LANKA (332) - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 120-3 V SRI LANKA (332) - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 120-3 in reply to Sri Lanka's first innings of 332 at tea on the second day of the second and final test on Sunday.</p>
</text>
